{
  "description": "The Activity rule of the task detail (openspec phone-task-focus, task-view-focus, decision 37, proposal-and-discussion): places has one entry for each event type of contracts/samples/schema-samples.json; cases are thread rows with the expected in_activity, the row style (message, line, or null when the row shows only in Session), the author of a message (agent or person) and the line of the Activity row (null: the row uses its usual text). threads are whole threads with the expected Activity rows: the rows that depend on later events (an open or answered question, a replaced or approved proposal, a gate card). The desktop (desktop/src/renderer/src/activity-model.ts) and the phone (android/control Activity.kt) run the same cases. Synthetic data, written by hand on 2026-11-24; the message.agent source and the nudge cases on 2026-11-25 (agent-pushes-updates); the styles and threads on 2026-11-26 (proposal-and-discussion).",
